1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:01,335
I'm a werewolf.

2
00:00:01,385 --> 00:00:02,966
So's my best mate.

3
00:00:03,016 --> 00:00:05,924
And his mum's just pointed a shotgun at us.

4
00:00:06,234 --> 00:00:07,299
For twenty years,

5
00:00:07,349 --> 00:00:10,549
his uncle Mick sat under the lamp at the end of our road.

6
00:00:10,599 --> 00:00:12,319
Watching for wolves.

7
00:00:12,369 --> 00:00:14,042
Mick died this spring.

8
00:00:14,092 --> 00:00:15,352
And last full moon,

9
00:00:15,402 --> 00:00:18,287
Danny pulled the silver out of Mick's windowsill.

10
00:00:18,337 --> 00:00:19,921
So we could get out.

11
00:00:20,231 --> 00:00:21,021
So tonight,

12
00:00:21,071 --> 00:00:21,947
we ran.

13
00:00:21,997 --> 00:00:23,027
Miles of moor,

14
00:00:23,077 --> 00:00:25,133
going by under my hands.

15
00:00:25,363 --> 00:00:26,903
Coming back down Moor End,

16
00:00:26,953 --> 00:00:28,586
a torch clicked on.

17
00:00:28,636 --> 00:00:29,691
Under Mick's lamp.

18
00:00:29,741 --> 00:00:31,576
Where nobody should be.

19
00:00:31,726 --> 00:00:34,002
Someone had been keeping his watch.

20
00:00:34,152 --> 00:00:35,368
Danny's mum.

21
00:00:35,918 --> 00:00:37,058
Mick's old shotgun.

22
00:00:37,108 --> 00:00:38,113
Both barrels.

23
00:00:38,163 --> 00:00:39,014
Silver.

24
00:00:39,244 --> 00:00:39,754
She said,

25
00:00:39,804 --> 00:00:41,334
I've watched you since you were eight,

26
00:00:41,384 --> 00:00:42,324
love.

27
00:00:42,394 --> 00:00:43,945
Then she turned the gun.

28
00:00:43,995 --> 00:00:45,292
Away from me.

29
00:00:45,362 --> 00:00:46,560
Onto Danny.

30
00:00:47,110 --> 00:00:49,030
She said, it runs in our family.

31
00:00:49,080 --> 00:00:50,357
Not yours.

32
00:00:50,508 --> 00:00:52,033
Danny's claws came up.

33
00:00:52,083 --> 00:00:53,758
Her finger tightened.

34
00:00:53,808 --> 00:00:55,513
Go home, love.
